<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37767" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξω-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>foreign,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκονομίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					21.97
				</span></i>
			; of a plant, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHolm.</u>
				17.31
			</span></i>; <i>outlying,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					21 ii 1
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>; <i>alien,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγενής,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2686
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Iasos</span>); of heirs, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				22.20.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμνῳδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					4.353
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				c11
			</span></i> (Pergam.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἑστιάσεις</span>
			banquets <i>in other men's houses,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδιωτικαἱ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epict.
				<u>Ench.</u>
				33.6
			</span></i>(v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>uninitiated,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς θρησκείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					4.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				179
			</span></i>.</div>
